.TH TINYDNS-DATA 1 "2026-07-23" "rgbdns 0.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
tinydns-data \- compile a tinydns zone database
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tinydns-data
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads tinydns-format zone source from
.I data
in the current directory and writes
.IR data.cdb .
.SH ANAME
The rgbdns-specific form
.BI A owner : target : ttl
configures address flattening. For A and AAAA queries, tinydns resolves
.I target
and returns its addresses with
.I owner
as the authoritative record owner. The TTL defaults to 300 and caps the
upstream TTL. ANAME may coexist with apex authority data, but not with A,
AAAA, or CNAME data at the same owner.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tinydns (1),
.BR tinydns-edit (1)
